{"5096260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Island Hopping Delivery", "steam_appid": 5096260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take to the skies...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and enjoy the peaceful life of a seaplane delivery pilot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world of scattered islands, take on delivery jobs, and build your own little business from the cockpit of your cargo seaplane. Fly at your own pace, discover new destinations, and enjoy the freedom of traveling between islands while keeping your plane and cargo in good shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.poster.avif?t=1787355760\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.webm?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.mp4?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Seaplane</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your cargo seaplane and handle its systems as you fly. Use the landing gear, flaps, lights, and other controls to prepare for takeoff, enjoy smooth flights, and make careful landings at your destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.poster.avif?t=1787355760\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.webm?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.mp4?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Jobs and Money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from available delivery jobs and decide which ones to take. Earn money by completing deliveries and use your earnings to keep your plane running, improve its parts, and prepare for new adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handle Cargo With Care</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every package is worth money, so treat your cargo carefully. Load and drag packages without damaging them, transport them safely, and deliver them in good condition. Damaged cargo means less money in your pocket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maintain and Upgrade Your Plane</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seaplane is your most important tool. Pay for repairs when things wear down and invest your earnings into upgrading different parts of the aircraft. Keep improving your plane and make each flight a little better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly between many beautiful islands and discover new places along the way. Take on deliveries to different destinations, find your favorite routes, and enjoy the feeling of being out on the open water and in the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a Break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying and making deliveries can be a busy day, so remember to look after yourself along the way. Grab something to eat or drink, relax between jobs, and enjoy the slower side of life as a pilot.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take to the skies...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and enjoy the peaceful life of a seaplane delivery pilot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world of scattered islands, take on delivery jobs, and build your own little business from the cockpit of your cargo seaplane. Fly at your own pace, discover new destinations, and enjoy the freedom of traveling between islands while keeping your plane and cargo in good shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.poster.avif?t=1787355760\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.webm?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/b275b74aa9c8d50bfe8f0a0aaa8d6970.mp4?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Seaplane</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your cargo seaplane and handle its systems as you fly. Use the landing gear, flaps, lights, and other controls to prepare for takeoff, enjoy smooth flights, and make careful landings at your destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.poster.avif?t=1787355760\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.webm?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/extras/f6a767cc4ac05c153f075b66c2b2e532.mp4?t=1787355760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Jobs and Money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from available delivery jobs and decide which ones to take. Earn money by completing deliveries and use your earnings to keep your plane running, improve its parts, and prepare for new adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handle Cargo With Care</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every package is worth money, so treat your cargo carefully. Load and drag packages without damaging them, transport them safely, and deliver them in good condition. Damaged cargo means less money in your pocket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maintain and Upgrade Your Plane</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seaplane is your most important tool. Pay for repairs when things wear down and invest your earnings into upgrading different parts of the aircraft. Keep improving your plane and make each flight a little better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly between many beautiful islands and discover new places along the way. Take on deliveries to different destinations, find your favorite routes, and enjoy the feeling of being out on the open water and in the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a Break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying and making deliveries can be a busy day, so remember to look after yourself along the way. Grab something to eat or drink, relax between jobs, and enjoy the slower side of life as a pilot.</p>", "short_description": "Team up with your crew and take to the skies in a world of scattered islands and challenging delivery missions. Handle delicate cargo with care, keep your plane in top condition, and work together to overcome the challenges of each flight.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/a8bcdefc8a4fc9cd98eaa684e3fecbfa747b0dd6/header.jpg?t=1787355760", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/c9510ad8b689e224cb6344a21fff21f073ece8e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787355760", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5096260/c9510ad8b689e224cb6344a21fff21f073ece8e6/c